<!-- PYQs -->
<section class="section" id="pyq">
  <div class="section-title">Previous Year Questions</div>
  <p style="font-size:13px; color:var(--slate); margin-bottom:16px;">Click on an option to check your answer.</p>

  <div class="pyq-block">
    <div class="pyq-meta">TIER I · 2025 · QUANTITATIVE APTITUDE</div>
    <div class="pyq-q">If the simple interest on ₹4,000 for 3 years is ₹600, what is the rate of interest per annum?</div>
    <ul class="pyq-opts">
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">A) 4%</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, true)">B) 5%</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">C) 6%</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">D) 3.5%</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="pyq-answer">✅ Answer: B — SI = (P×R×T)/100 → 600 = (4000×R×3)/100 → R = 5%</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pyq-block">
    <div class="pyq-meta">TIER I · 2025 · GENERAL AWARENESS</div>
    <div class="pyq-q">Which Article of the Indian Constitution deals with the Right to Equality?</div>
    <ul class="pyq-opts">
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">A) Article 12–18</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, true)">B) Article 14–18</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">C) Article 19–22</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">D) Article 20–24</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="pyq-answer">✅ Answer: B — Articles 14 to 18 cover the Right to Equality (equality before law, no discrimination, abolition of untouchability, etc.)</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pyq-block">
    <div class="pyq-meta">TIER I · 2024 · ENGLISH</div>
    <div class="pyq-q">Choose the word most SIMILAR in meaning to: <em>AMELIORATE</em></div>
    <ul class="pyq-opts">
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">A) Worsen</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">B) Ignore</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, true)">C) Improve</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">D) Preserve</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="pyq-answer">✅ Answer: C — "Ameliorate" means to make something bad or unsatisfactory better.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pyq-block">
    <div class="pyq-meta">TIER I · 2024 · REASONING</div>
    <div class="pyq-q">In a code language, PENCIL is written as QFODLM. How is ERASER coded?</div>
    <ul class="pyq-opts">
      <li onclick="check(this, true)">A) FSBTFS</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">B) FSBSFT</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">C) GTBUGT</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">D) ESBTFS</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="pyq-answer">✅ Answer: A — Each letter is shifted +1: E→F, R→S, A→B, S→T, E→F, R→S = FSBTFS</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pyq-block">
    <div class="pyq-meta">TIER I · 2025 · QUANTITATIVE APTITUDE</div>
    <div class="pyq-q">A train 240 m long passes a pole in 24 seconds. How long will it take to pass a platform 120 m long?</div>
    <ul class="pyq-opts">
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">A) 30 sec</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">B) 32 sec</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, true)">C) 36 sec</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">D) 40 sec</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="pyq-answer">✅ Answer: C — Speed = 240/24 = 10 m/s. Distance = 240+120 = 360 m. Time = 360/10 = 36 sec.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="pyq-block">
    <div class="pyq-meta">TIER I · 2024 · GENERAL AWARENESS</div>
    <div class="pyq-q">The Headquarters of the International Monetary Fund (IMF) is located in:</div>
    <ul class="pyq-opts">
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">A) New York</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">B) Geneva</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, true)">C) Washington D.C.</li>
      <li onclick="check(this, false)">D) Vienna</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="pyq-answer">✅ Answer: C — The IMF was established in 1944 and is headquartered in Washington D.C., USA.</div>
  </div>
